# Files the Worker must NOT publish (gitignore syntax). The assets directory
# is the repo root (wrangler.jsonc), so everything that isn't the site itself
# is listed here: repo machinery, the Worker's own source and config, notes,
# tooling, and the data tables the picker's JSON is built from.
# A leading / anchors a name to the repo root. Without it, "data" would also
# hide assets/data/, which the picker loads.
/.git
/.github
/.claude
/.wrangler
/.gitignore
/.gitattributes
/.assetsignore
/.nojekyll
/CNAME
/wrangler.jsonc
/worker
/docs
/tools
/data
/scratch
.DS_Store
node_modules
